; ============================================================================
; Dynamic loader (mwinload.rs)
; ============================================================================
; The whole loader family is non-opt-in: every export carries `/alternatename`
; so a client's runtime symbol resolution (LoadLibrary/GetProcAddress) is the
; seam that brings dynamically-bound APIs and substitutable engines under the
; same redirection as static imports (SHIM-D16). None opt out.

 mFreeLibrary
 mGetModuleHandleA
 mGetModuleHandleExA
 mGetModuleHandleExW
 mGetModuleHandleW
 mGetProcAddress
 mLoadLibraryA
 mLoadLibraryExA
 mLoadLibraryExW
 mLoadLibraryW

; ============================================================================
; WebCore — out of scope for this shim (SHIM-D5); listed for parity only.
; ============================================================================
;mWebCoreActivate
;mWebCoreSetMetadata
;mWebCoreShutdown
